0015E1  3               ;___FILTER_________________________________________________
0015E1  3               ;
0015E1  3               ; SET SID FILTERS
0015E1  3               ;
0015E1  3               ;  FILTER CUTOFF, RESONANCE, VOICE 1 ENABLE, VOICE 2 ENABLE, VOICE 3 ENABLE, EXTERNAL ENABLE, FILTER MODE, VOLUME
